<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink188-kilavi">
       viruntuvāyilākap pukunta talaimakaṉ talaivi ilvāḻkkaic ciṟappukkaṇṭu makiḻntu colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
       Spoken joyfully by the hero who entered as a guest, having seen the excellence of the heroine's home life.</p>
  </div>  
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink188">
<l>iruṅkaḻic cēyiṟā viṉappuḷ ḷāruṅ</l>
<l>koṟkaik kōmāṉ koṟkaiyam peruntuṟai</l>
<l>vaikaṟai malaru neytal pōlat</l>
<l>takaiperi tuṭaiya kātali kaṇṇē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>The eyes of [my] lady-love greatly possess fitness,</l>
        <l>Like the Neytal flower that blooms at dawn</l>
        <l>In the big ghat of Koṟkai, of the king of Koṟkai,</l>
        <l>Where birds in groups become full </l>
        <l>[With] red prawns in the dark backwaters.</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
